# SHOWSTOPPER: what each power does. Shot A: the first shot of each volley
# flares two more out on the diagonals; Shot B: the same, and every shot
# bigger and stronger. Helper A: a one-eyed blob that fires when she does;
# Helper B: a stubby one that also keeps firing while A is held. Bomb A:
# a bomb where each dash starts; Bomb B: a trail of three. Shield A: one
# spiked ball circles her and stops shots until it breaks; Shield B: five.
# Life A: a heart back. Life B (Extend): four hearts, and a heart back.
game showstopper
wait 5
cheat run
cheat arena
cheat god
cheat face 6
cheat pow 2 1
press A 1
expect shots == 3
expect bigshots == 0
wait 60
cheat pow 2 2
press A 1
expect shots == 3
expect bigshots == 3
wait 60
# the helpers
cheat pow 3 1
press A 1
expect optshots == 1
wait 60
hold A 30
expect optshots >= 1
release A
wait 60
cheat pow 3 2
hold UP A 1
hold A 30
expect optshots >= 4
release A
wait 60
# bombs
cheat pow 4 1
press B 1
expect bombs == 1
wait 60
expect bombs == 0
cheat pow 4 2
press B 1
wait 12
expect bombs == 3
wait 60
# the shield stops a shot (the ball loses strength)
cheat pow 5 1
expect shield0 == 3
cheat pos 168 2504
cheat mortal
cheat bullet 0 186 2504 0 0
cheat bullet 0 168 2486 0 0
cheat bullet 0 150 2504 0 0
cheat bullet 0 168 2522 0 0
wait 40
expect hits == 0
expect shield0 < 3
cheat god
cheat pow 5 2
expect shield4 == 3
expect pow5 == 2
# hearts
cheat hp 1
cheat pow 1 1
expect hp == 2
expect max_hp == 3
cheat pow 1 2
expect max_hp == 4
expect hp == 3
cheat pow 1 2
expect max_hp == 4
expect hp == 4
